+window 2; no axiom surface touched). The wall-breaking exercise
+classified every possible escape from the readout-selection trap into
+four shapes (M1 marked point / M2 mixed degree / M3 order / M4
+lattice) and showed the landed walls T1/T7 covered only part of one.
+This block runs the census the classification demanded. The outcome:
+the M4 route DIES reading-independently with four kills; the M2
+involution subfamily closes with two sterile-shape theorems; M3 is an
+amplifier, not an escape; and the completed coverage map leaves
+exactly ONE unpriced open shape.
