+by the checker and repaired mid-block (a third disjointness reading;
+the universal form of the vacuity kill) — disclosed, adopted, re-run.
+Independent audit still required.
+
+## Q1 — the M4 adjudication: the route DIES, reading-independently
+
+The additivity sentence byte-quoted with EVERY "disjoint" occurrence
+in the memo listed (exactly two; zero definitions of record
+disjointness; "adjacency" occurs once, inside Lattice, never in
+Record). Three readings adjudicated — site-support disjointness
+(licensed, two discriminants); non-adjacency (ZERO license hits, and
+killed by content-alone anyway); and the checker's find, content
+disjointness (licensed, and an ANTI-escape: it exempts exactly the
+equal-content collections, which is the target orbit itself). The
+route dies under all three:
