+1. **The contradicting instance**: adjacent single-site records have
+   disjoint supports, so additivity covers them; any nonzero gluing
+   defect contradicts the axiom (exhibited: I = 31/27 vs the required
+   4/27).
+2. **The content-alone kill** (reading-independent): a
+   displacement-dependent defect makes the readout depend on relative
+   position, violating "determined by record content alone".
+3. **Geometric vacuity, universal form**: Z^3's nearest-neighbour
