+   so no three sites anywhere are pairwise adjacent, and the free C3
+   orbit (pairwise squared distances 2) has ZERO adjacency
+   interfaces. The defect never even fires on the object of interest.
+4. **R4's self-defeat** (the anti-escape structure).
+
+The counterfactual price, computed anyway: all 343 members of the
+forbidden Z-valued defect family leave the induced constraint set at
+Z — a defect cannot manufacture a denominator, and the single-record
+configuration binds alpha before any interface exists. **The
+additivity clause buys zero selection power in either direction.**
