   892	                "still not typed as an angle anywhere: its home package contains zero occurrences "
   893	                "of 'radian', so the conversion sentence would still have to be supplied."
   894	                + (
   895	                    "  This candidate's exact value IS 2/3, so the referent is the only thing "
   896	                    "standing between it and bin 7."
   897	                    if cand["id"] in EXACTLY_TWO_THIRDS
   898	                    else "  Its value also misses 2/3."
