   165	## Verdict
   166	
   167	The binding that spent two blocks looking five-ways ambiguous was
   168	one function wearing five expressions, and the function, run where
   169	the families finally disagree, picks its side: the construction is
   170	F_dim, the retained arithmetic is F_res, and the triangle's double
   171	identity was the only thing ever holding them together. What remains
   172	of the readout obligation's positive half is a single sentence-sized
   173	question — which space does the record read — with a computable
   174	answer at C4 and a named way to lose. The wall didn't just move; it
   175	turned into a fork with two prongs and a test. Independent audit
