+
+Scope: stacked delta only, `3a01b7c0f7cc180cf043c3d38416cdce0c4b9a5c..867aff0edc16f64b5e8d5cc1022cbf9ce92b92de` (129 files). The supplied `RL_DIFF_PR5995.txt` matches this Git delta byte-for-byte.
